                    },
                    "message": "The problem here is partially the hard-coding of \"host0\"."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/systems.hpp",
                    "line": 993,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Allen.Wang",
                        "email": "Allen_Wang@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "Allen-Hsu-Wang"
                    },
                    "message": "I refer to getAutomaticRetryPolicy URI to return here for non-exist host0.\n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/bmcweb/blob/master/redfish-core/lib/systems.hpp#L1235-L1251\n\nI notice that @oliver.brewka@9elements.com also implement it at https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/bmcweb/+/73855\n\nShould we just waiting Oliver's commit landing or use this workaround to avoid internal errors now?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/systems.hpp",
                    "line": 1001,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Gunnar Mills",
                        "email": "gunnar@gmills.xyz",
                        "username": "gtmills"
                    },
                    "message": "Any idea why EBADR is needed? I thought boost::asio::error::host_unreachable would cover?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/systems.hpp",
                    "line": 1001,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Allen.Wang",
                        "email": "Allen_Wang@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "Allen-Hsu-Wang"
                    },
                    "message": "I not very sure, I just refer to existing code from getAutomaticRetryPolicy URI and its works.\n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/bmcweb/blob/master/redfish-core/lib/systems.hpp#L1235-L1251\n\nboost::asio::error::host_unreachable seems is error happens on asio socket call,\nand this commit want to fix the dbus object not exist case."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/systems.hpp",
                    "line": 1004,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Gunnar Mills",
                        "email": "gunnar@gmills.xyz",
                        "username": "gtmills"
                    },
                    "message": "not sure why the \"s\" is needed. Oh well."
                }
